    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Image Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Vision AI. The selection feels right because it's a robust and well-documented option for generating image descriptions, and the code will directly identify it. I am focused on making it a reliable foundation.\n\n\n**Defining the Core Structure**\n\nI'm now writing the Python code, focusing on using the `google-cloud-vision` library for image description. My current task is to outline the structure of the `describe_image.py` file, so the image description can work. This process requires me to integrate the core components for the script.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887058481,
          "start": 1789887055913
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd950829001rgj7GURrKBCHm0",
